scenario.en:
Case 1: A running Node HTTP server is sent SIGKILL by the kernel (kill -9). What exit code does its supervisor observe?

Case 2:
process.on('exit', () => {
  setTimeout(() => console.log('flushed'), 0);
  console.log('exit handler ran');
});
process.exit(0);

What is printed?

